    {
      "id": "bs-importer",
      "kind": "plugin",
      "runtime": "native",
      "category": "migration",
      "official": true,
      "name": {
        "zh-CN": "Blessing Skin 扩展数据迁移助手",
        "en": "Blessing Skin Extension Importer"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "按需安装、迁完可卸载的 Tier 2 原生插件：通过直连 BS 数据库或 Export Bridge 补迁旧站扩展表，并自动发现支持通用 bsMigrateDescribe/bsMigrateImport 协议的已安装插件以迁移其旧站 options 与扩展表数据",
        "en": "On-demand Tier 2 native plugin to import Blessing Skin third-party extension tables and dynamically discovered plugin migrations (options & custom tables via the generic bsMigrateDescribe/bsMigrateImport protocol) via direct DB or Export Bridge; safe to uninstall after migration"
      },
      "authors": [
        "Entropy-Increase-Team"
      ],
      "license": "MIT",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Entropy-Increase-Team/skinloom-plugins",
      "repository": "https://github.com/Entropy-Increase-Team/skinloom-plugins",
      "latest": "1.1.0",
      "versions": [
        {
          "version": "1.1.0",
          "apiVersion": 1,
          "nativeProtocolVersion": 1,
          "engines": {
            "skinloom": ">=1.1.3 <2.0.0",
            "go": ">=1.26.10"
          },
          "permissions": [
            "admin.ui",
            "native.exec",
            "storage.sql",
            "http.stream",
            "users.read",
            "textures.read"
          ],
          "dependencies": {},
          "optionalDependencies": {
            "invitation-codes": "^1.0.0",
            "mojang-verification": "^1.0.0",
            "texture-description": "^1.0.0"
          },
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T09:25:00Z",
          "yanked": false,
          "changelog": "- 重构为完全通用的 IoC 动态插件迁移框架：通过宿主 `Services.Discover` 自动发现已安装且声明 `bsMigrateDescribe` / `bsMigrateImport` 的插件（如 `mua-union` 等），零特定插件硬编码。\n- 支持 Blessing Skin Export Bridge 连接 JSON 一键粘贴自动拆分与 `/plugin/skinloom-bridge` 路径规范化。\n- 加固动态 Provider 最小权限边界：严禁读取 BS 核心表、敏感选项键及过宽前缀，采用三方言兼容 `LIKE ... ESCAPE '!'`、禁用 Bridge 重定向、校验非公网 IP 并对异常报文与 DSN 凭据脱敏；SSE 流鉴权前置至响应头之前。\n- 优化管理页体验：展示各动态 Provider 声明读取范围、增加正式导入二次确认、独立按钮加载态、探测后勾选状态同步、结构化导入结果摘要卡与移动端日志换行。\n- 对齐 Go SDK 正式依赖至 `skinloom v1.1.3`（最低宿主版本要求 `>=1.1.3 <2.0.0`）。",
          "changelogI18n": {
            "zh-CN": "- 重构为完全通用的 IoC 动态插件迁移框架：通过宿主 `Services.Discover` 自动发现已安装且声明 `bsMigrateDescribe` / `bsMigrateImport` 的插件（如 `mua-union` 等），零特定插件硬编码。\n- 支持 Blessing Skin Export Bridge 连接 JSON 一键粘贴自动拆分与 `/plugin/skinloom-bridge` 路径规范化。\n- 加固动态 Provider 最小权限边界：严禁读取 BS 核心表、敏感选项键及过宽前缀，采用三方言兼容 `LIKE ... ESCAPE '!'`、禁用 Bridge 重定向、校验非公网 IP 并对异常报文与 DSN 凭据脱敏；SSE 流鉴权前置至响应头之前。\n- 优化管理页体验：展示各动态 Provider 声明读取范围、增加正式导入二次确认、独立按钮加载态、探测后勾选状态同步、结构化导入结果摘要卡与移动端日志换行。\n- 对齐 Go SDK 正式依赖至 `skinloom v1.1.3`（最低宿主版本要求 `>=1.1.3 <2.0.0`）。",
            "en": "- Refactored into a fully generic IoC dynamic plugin migration framework using host `Services.Discover` to discover and run any installed plugin implementing `bsMigrateDescribe` / `bsMigrateImport` with zero plugin-specific hardcoding.\n- Added automatic JSON credential bundle splitting and `/plugin/skinloom-bridge` URL normalization for Blessing Skin Export Bridge connections.\n- Hardened dynamic provider least-privilege boundaries: blocks BS core tables, sensitive option keys, and overly broad prefixes; uses three-dialect `LIKE ... ESCAPE '!'`, disables Bridge redirects, enforces public-IP checks, scrubs secrets/DSNs from errors, and authenticates SSE streams before flushing headers.\n- Polished admin UI with per-provider read-scope display, confirmation modal before live imports, independent action spinners, structured import report summary cards, and mobile log wrapping.\n- Aligned Go SDK dependency to published `skinloom v1.1.3` (requires host `>=1.1.3 <2.0.0`)."
          },
