      "id": "mua-union",
      "kind": "plugin",
      "runtime": "native",
      "category": "auth",
      "official": true,
      "name": {
        "zh-CN": "MUA Union 联合认证",
        "en": "MUA Union Federation"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "官方 Tier 2 原生插件：接入中国高校 Minecraft 联盟（MUA）联合皮肤站认证体系，支持成员皮肤站白名单同步、角色跨站绑定与改名同步、联合黑名单管理及 Union OAuth2 单点登录",
        "en": "Official Tier 2 native plugin integrating the Minecraft University Alliance (MUA) Union federation protocol: member skinDomains sync, cross-site player binding and lifecycle sync, union blacklist management, and Union OAuth2 SSO"
      },
      "authors": [
        "Entropy-Increase-Team"
      ],
      "license": "MIT",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Entropy-Increase-Team/skinloom-plugins",
      "repository": "https://github.com/Entropy-Increase-Team/skinloom-plugins",
      "latest": "1.0.0",
      "versions": [
        {
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "apiVersion": 1,
          "nativeProtocolVersion": 1,
          "engines": {
            "skinloom": ">=1.1.3 <2.0.0",
            "go": ">=1.26.10"
          },
          "permissions": [
            "admin.ui",
            "native.exec",
            "storage.sql",
            "routes.public",
            "yggdrasil.extend",
            "yggdrasil.key.write",
            "players.uuid.write",
            "users.read",
            "players.read",
            "cron"
          ],
          "dependencies": {},
          "optionalDependencies": {
            "bs-importer": "^1.0.0"
          },
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T09:25:00Z",
          "yanked": false,
          "changelog": "- 首个官方 5 平台 Tier 2 原生 Go 版本，基于 `yggdrasil-connect` 协议重构，完整兼容中国高校 Minecraft 联盟（MUA）Union 联合认证体系。\n- 支持 RSA-SHA256 `UnionHostVerify` 防重放 Webhook 验签、成员站 `skinDomains` 动态同步、玩家创建/改名/删除出站同步，以及带因果合并与租约认领的 SQL 失败重试队列。\n- 提供中英双语用户跨站绑定中心（严格角色归属权防 IDOR 校验）、管理员控制台（接入就绪检查、中心版本对比、双向连通性诊断、密钥指纹复制）与联合黑名单管理。\n- 内置 MUA Union OAuth2 单点登录（自动管理 4096 位 RSA 签名密钥对与分片 PKCS#1 v1.5 加密，严格校验用户状态与邮箱验证要求）；所有高危远端回调均默认关闭并强制要求 `superadmin` 权限与审计落盘。\n- 实现通用 `bsMigrateDescribe` / `bsMigrateImport` 迁移协议，可被官方 `bs-importer`（v1.1.0+）自动发现，支持从旧版 Blessing Skin 一键幂等迁移 MUA Union 配置、成员站列表与 OAuth2 密钥对。",
          "changelogI18n": {
            "zh-CN": "- 首个官方 5 平台 Tier 2 原生 Go 版本，基于 `yggdrasil-connect` 协议重构，完整兼容中国高校 Minecraft 联盟（MUA）Union 联合认证体系。\n- 支持 RSA-SHA256 `UnionHostVerify` 防重放 Webhook 验签、成员站 `skinDomains` 动态同步、玩家创建/改名/删除出站同步，以及带因果合并与租约认领的 SQL 失败重试队列。\n- 提供中英双语用户跨站绑定中心（严格角色归属权防 IDOR 校验）、管理员控制台（接入就绪检查、中心版本对比、双向连通性诊断、密钥指纹复制）与联合黑名单管理。\n- 内置 MUA Union OAuth2 单点登录（自动管理 4096 位 RSA 签名密钥对与分片 PKCS#1 v1.5 加密，严格校验用户状态与邮箱验证要求）；所有高危远端回调均默认关闭并强制要求 `superadmin` 权限与审计落盘。\n- 实现通用 `bsMigrateDescribe` / `bsMigrateImport` 迁移协议，可被官方 `bs-importer`（v1.1.0+）自动发现，支持从旧版 Blessing Skin 一键幂等迁移 MUA Union 配置、成员站列表与 OAuth2 密钥对。",
            "en": "- Initial official 5-platform Tier 2 native Go release implementing full Minecraft University Alliance (MUA) Union federation protocol compatibility.\n- Includes RSA-SHA256 `UnionHostVerify` replay-safe webhooks, dynamic member `skinDomains` sync, outbound player lifecycle sync, and a SQL retry outbox with causal coalescing and lease claiming.\n- Provides bilingual User Binding Center (with strict player ownership anti-IDOR checks), Admin Console (readiness checklist, Hub version comparison, two-way diagnostics, key fingerprints), and Union Blacklist management.\n- Supports MUA Union OAuth2 SSO with auto-managed 4096-bit RSA signing keys, chunked PKCS#1 v1.5 encryption, and strict active/email-verified enforcement; all high-risk remote webhooks are opt-in, superadmin-gated, and audited.\n- Implements the generic `bsMigrateDescribe` / `bsMigrateImport` migration protocol for automatic discovery by official `bs-importer` (v1.1.0+), enabling one-click idempotent migration of legacy Blessing Skin MUA Union options, member server list, and OAuth2 keypair."
          },
